    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Does Rolling the Dice Decide a Person's Ending?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice Making Ending</strong> is a casual game designed to answer three questions you might have:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366060/extras/3449e5ed981dd9e33292b2e9c861d1a5.avif?t=1749138735\" width=594 height=158 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can life be determined by rolling a die?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if a game had no gameplay\u2014only endings, like watching internet shorts? Would it still be fun?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of ending do I truly want?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Play:</strong> While rolling the dice, you can experience the game at a fast pace. Anyone can enjoy it casually without pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Just like the many faces of a die, explore a variety of episodes and endings. A single person\u2019s life can lead to countless possibilities\u2014discover them all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Choice:</strong> What will your choice be? Ask yourself and find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>bluestruggle</strong> is a one-person indie game development team creating games as a hobby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making games is fun, but it also comes with its fair share of struggles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To all indie game developers out there\u2014stay healthy and keep going! You got this! \ud83d\udc99\u2728</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Does Rolling the Dice Decide a Person's Ending?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice Making Ending</strong> is a casual game designed to answer three questions you might have:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366060/extras/3449e5ed981dd9e33292b2e9c861d1a5.avif?t=1749138735\" width=594 height=158 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can life be determined by rolling a die?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if a game had no gameplay\u2014only endings, like watching internet shorts? Would it still be fun?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of ending do I truly want?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Play:</strong> While rolling the dice, you can experience the game at a fast pace. Anyone can enjoy it casually without pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Just like the many faces of a die, explore a variety of episodes and endings. A single person\u2019s life can lead to countless possibilities\u2014discover them all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Choice:</strong> What will your choice be? Ask yourself and find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>bluestruggle</strong> is a one-person indie game development team creating games as a hobby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making games is fun, but it also comes with its fair share of struggles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To all indie game developers out there\u2014stay healthy and keep going! You got this! \ud83d\udc99\u2728</p>",
